---
const points = [
  "The team's growing fast, and what's been living in your head needs to become systems other people can run.",
  "There's real money in the bank for the first time, and no clear plan for where it goes.",
  "Hiring is next, but there's no clear philosophy for who to bring on first or how the org should be structured as it grows.",
  "Visibility into performance, budget, and team health is already slipping as headcount grows.",
  "The culture is already changing, and it hasn't been intentionally defined.",
];
---

<section class="section section--alt who">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="section-heading">
      <span class="eyebrow">Who this is for</span>
      <h2>The product works. Investors believed in it. And somehow, everything still runs through you.</h2>
    </div>
    <p class="who__lead">This is for you if:</p>
    <ul class="who__list">
      {points.map((point) => <li>{point}</li>)}
    </ul>
    <p class="who__closing">If that's the season you're in, let's talk.</p>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .who__lead {
    margin-top: var(--space-4);
    font-size: var(--fs-body-lg);
    font-weight: 600;
  }

  .who__list {
    margin-top: var(--space-3);
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: var(--space-2);
    max-width: var(--content-narrow);
  }

  .who__list li {
    position: relative;
    padding-left: 1.25em;
    color: var(--color-ink-soft);
    line-height: var(--lh-relaxed);
  }

  .who__list li::before {
    content: "—";
    position: absolute;
    left: 0;
    color: var(--color-accent);
  }

  .who__closing {
    margin-top: var(--space-4);
    font-family: var(--font-serif);
    font-size: var(--fs-h3);
  }
</style>
